{
 "encounter_id": "00542",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I've got numbness in my right hand and it's really scaring me. I keep thinking it's a stroke, or my spine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Righto, let's sort it out. Which fingers are numb?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The thumb, the pointer finger and the middle one. Not the little finger. And it's worse when I'm gripping something, like the steering wheel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About two months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it do anything else, besides numbness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tingling at night, like pins and needles. It wakes me up and I have to shake my hand out. And I've been dropping things, my coffee mug, a screwdriver last week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A sore ache in the wrist, and sometimes it runs up the forearm. Shaking it out helps a bit.",
   "pause": 3
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any pain in your neck?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no neck pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fall or injury to the wrist?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling in the wrist or hand?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, not that I've noticed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss lately?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my weight's been steady. If anything it's gone up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I work on a production line, packing parts, same movement all day with a scanner gun."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll come to that. What medicines are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin, 500 mg twice a day, for the diabetes. Every day, never miss. Well, mostly. The evening one I sometimes forget."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fair enough. Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There's a small white tablet for my cholesterol, I take it at night. I can't remember the name of it, my wife keeps the box."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I was told as a kid I'm allergic to it, but I honestly don't remember what happened."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine, I'll note it down. What other conditions have you got?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, about six years. High cholesterol. Gout, though I haven't had a flare this year. And sleep apnoea, I use a machine at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hernia repair, about eight years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family history of anything important?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a heart attack at sixty. And my sister has carpal tunnel syndrome, she's a hairdresser."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Interesting. Do you smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I quit smoking five years ago. And I have two beers on the weekend, no more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you exercise at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk the dog on Sundays. That's about it, to be honest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alright. Any chest pain or palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my heart feels fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And passing urine, any trouble there, more than usual?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, that's normal. I'm drinking the same as always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. Blood pressure is 136 over 84, pulse is 80 beats per minute.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hands out, palms up. I'll tap over the wrist crease here. Tell me what you feel.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ow, tingling shoots into my fingers. That's exactly the feeling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling. Now push the backs of your hands together, wrists bent, and hold for a minute.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's coming on already. Pins and needles in the same three fingers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yep. Bending the wrist like that brings on the same tingling. Now light touch on each fingertip, eyes closed.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's duller on the thumb and the first two fingers. The little finger feels normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Reduced feeling in the thumb, index and middle fingers, then. And squeeze my fingers as hard as you can.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? It doesn't feel strong."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Grip is a little weaker on the right than the left. Based on all this, it looks like carpal tunnel syndrome, where a nerve gets squeezed in the wrist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's not a stroke? Or my spine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing here points to either. Your job could well be the trigger."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What do we do about it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a nerve conduction study, to measure how well the nerve is working. And a blood test for your HbA1c, to check your sugar control."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. And if the nerve test is normal?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then I might consider an X-ray of your neck, but we'll hold off on that for now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I've got a wrist splint in the right size here. Shall I show him how to put it on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please do. Wear it at night, so the wrist stays straight while you sleep. And take short breaks from the scanner gun during the day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do it, and I'll tell my supervisor. And the follow-up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come back if it's not better in four weeks, and bring the tablet box this time so we can get its name."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, my wife will find it. Thank you, doctor."
  }
 ],
